{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-33","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平行六面体与平行线与比例","englishTitle":"Similar parallelepipedal solids are to one another in the triplicate ratio of their corresponding sides.","book":11,"number":33,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":33,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","contentId":"euclid-11-33","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee4757d5f6a7aedab84ce96e1c5629e4cccde7a998c040d43e1e9d7e17c09df1","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-33.statement","euclid-11-33.construction.1","euclid-11-33.construction.2","euclid-11-33.proof.1","euclid-11-33.proof.2","euclid-11-33.proof.3","euclid-11-33.construction.3","euclid-11-33.proof.4","euclid-11-33.proof.5","euclid-11-33.proof.6","euclid-11-33.proof.7","euclid-11-33.proof.8","euclid-11-33.proof.9","euclid-11-33.proof.10","euclid-11-33.proof.11","euclid-11-33.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-33.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca3415ee0fb0b16129971305617ee33ab7ccb67eea3e422fc1afe4d0b11e2b83","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similar parallelepipedal solids are to one another in the triplicate ratio of their corresponding sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"类似的平行管道固体在立方比个相应的两侧相互形成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8dbfa7af985224740effb705c441e0d5990d3ee05acd6199b1f9e8169a89a87","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB, CD be similar parallelepipedal solids, and let AE be the side corresponding to CF; I say that the solid AB has to the solid CD the ratio triplicate of that which AE has to CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB,CD类似平行管道固体,让AE为CF;我说,AB固体与CD固体的比例是AE和CF固体的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"339edf5baf91f635bb54ccec07692e892610e7ec136c369f2204aac98163e371","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let EK, EL, EM be produced in a straight line with AE, GE, HE, let EK be made equal to CF, EL equal to FN, and further EM equal to FR, and let the parallelogram KL and the solid KP be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将EK,EL,EM直线延伸至AE,GE,HE直线,将EK直线延伸至CF,EL等于FN,再将EM等于FR,完成平行四边形,KL和KP固体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ed98b7d40a6d8df9197397f7bdf2c023617b026fd29f79aa9acd3eaa93847d7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the two sides KE, EL are equal to the two sides CF, FN, while the angle KEL is also equal to the angle CFN, inasmuch as the angle AEG is also equal to the angle CFN because of the similarity of the solids AB, CD, therefore the parallelogram KL is equal ltand similargt to the parallelogram CN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于双方KE,EL等于双方CF,FN,而KEL的角度也等于CFN,因为AEG的角度也等于CFN,因为固体的相似性是AB,CD,因此平行四边形,KL是平行四边形,CN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5b1013a438a3af63fc7954c3362e9f47cd5d37da1fd9ab2298fcf6ec0f53e1c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the parallelogram KM is also equal and similar to CR, and further EP to DF; therefore three parallelograms of the solid KP are equal and similar to three parallelograms of the solid CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,平行四边形 KM也等于CR, 更接近EP至DF;因此,KP固体中的3 平行四边形等于CD固体中的3 平行四边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3afc15409a3a75e84210eef7db139420e8fc91a179dd062404b504a053b645a","citations":["euclid-11-24","euclid-11-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the former three parallelograms are equal and similar to their opposites, and the latter three to their opposites; [[XI. 24](/principles/euclid-11-24)] therefore the whole solid KP is equal and similar to the whole solid CD. [[XI. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-11-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但前三块平行四边形是平等的,与它们的反面相似,后三块是相反的;因此,整个KP块固体是平等的,与整个CD块固体相似。 [[XI. 24](/principles/euclid-11-24)] [[XI. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-11-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f2f1298e589683dcd9c512639a33242c8595fea72ebdf6505b4bd5ef3d32af2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the parallelogram GK be completed, and on the parallelograms GK, KL as bases, and with the same height as that of AB, let the solids EO, LQ be completed."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"完成平行四边形 GK,平行四边形 KL为底边,高度与AB相同,完成EO LQ固体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ceafee443be1d441b368ed063b2499f786fb9b72af1f9bf47f7023154791336c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since; owing to the similarity of the solids AB, CD, as AE is to CF, so is EG to FN, and EH to FR, while CF is equal to EK, FN to EL, and FR to EM, therefore, as AE is to EK, so is GE to EL, and HE to EM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于AB、CD固体的相似性,AE对CF的比等于EG对FN,EH对FR的比,CF对EL,FR对FR对EM的比,因此,AE对EK的比等于GE对EL,HE对EM的比；AE 与 CF 之比等于 EG 与 FN 之比；AE 与 EK 之比等于 GE 与 EL 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29681e8eeca6ba3f0e2710c53bd88349bef756421a9630c9e07214440b3464e4","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AE is to EK, so is AG to the parallelogram GK, as GE is to EL, so is GK to KL, and, as HE is to EM, so is QE to KM; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore also, as the parallelogram AG is to GK, so is GK to KL, and QE to KM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AE对EK的比等于AG对平行四边形 GK的比,GE对EL的比等于GK对KL的比,HE对EM的比等于QE对KM的比,因此,平行四边形对AG对GK的比等于GK对KL的比,QE对KM的比；AE 与 EK 之比等于 AG 与 GK 之比；GE 与 EL 之比等于 GK 与 KL 之比；HE 与 EM 之比等于 QE 与 KM 之比；AG 与 GK 之比等于 GK 与 KL 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d0908bae5758a154cbdfa36420bc0bab4bbbfdb755ad6eae5c0d1d9085b59ce","citations":["euclid-11-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AG is to GK, so is the solid AB to the solid EO, as GK is to KL, so is the solid OE to the solid QL, and, as QE is to KM, so is the solid QL to the solid KP; [[XI. 32](/principles/euclid-11-32)] therefore also, as the solid AB is to EO, so is EO to QL, and QL to KP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AG对GK的比等于AB对EO固体的比,GK对KL的比等于OE对QL固体的比,QE对KM的比等于QL对KP固体的比;因此,AB对EO对EO的比等于EO对QL和QL对KP的比 [[XI. 32](/principles/euclid-11-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fcb4aeb5ad4215bcfc2f0b593aa136e5fb25f555a9c3de1eb087a1205352a6a5","citations":["euclid-5-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if four magnitudes be continuously proportional, the first has to the fourth the ratio triplicate of that which it has to the second; [[V. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-5-def-10)] therefore the solid AB has to KP the ratio triplicate of that which AB has to EO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果四级连续成比例, 前者的比重为四级, 则其比重为二级的三倍; 因此, 固体AB的比重为KP, AB的比重为EO。 [[V. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-5-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"63a62a9f48fcca07311041103b864a02fe1797b3d0374ba3a972ed77907e5884","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AB is to EO, so is the parallelogram AG to GK, and the straight line AE to EK [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]; hence the solid AB has also to KP the ratio triplicate of that which AE has to EK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB对EO的比等于平行四边形对AG对GK的比,以及AE对EK的直线;因此,AB的固体也等于KP,AE对EK的比的三倍；AB 与 EO 之比等于 AG 与 GK 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af369aad2bb017b54df1d6227547c8479a175f33e27e7ba7ddda69dedf18b03e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the solid KP is equal to the solid CD, and the straight line EK to CF; therefore the solid AB has also to the solid CD the ratio triplicate of that which the corresponding side of it, AE, has to the corresponding side CF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KP固体等于CD固体,EK至CF直线等于AB固体,因此AB固体也等于CD固体的三倍,而AE固体的对应方则等于CF固体的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b248a648f96a8fec418ca49254ba560a23bbb45b474c94de756fb4e62671c3d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if four straight lines be ltcontinuouslygt proportional, as the first is to the fourth, so will a parallelepipedal solid on the first be to the similar and similarly described parallelepipedal solid on the second, inasmuch as the first has to the fourth the ratio triplicate of that which it has to the second."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"质谱学。 从这一点可以看出,如果四条直线是它连续的成比例, 前者是第四条, 前者的平行管道固体也是第二条相似的和类似的平行管道固体, 因为前者的比重是第四条, 前者的比重是第二条的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-33.source","contentId":"euclid-11-33","revisionId":"euclid-11-33@raw-ee4757d5f6a7aeda","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db9ff57a4686d14a41784ee6fa5d759e95319938ec80822bd5872b42d477180f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-11-24:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-33.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-24","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"XI. 24"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-11-def-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-33.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 10"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-33.proof.5","euclid-11-33.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-11-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-33.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"XI. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-5-def-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-33.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-def-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"V. Def. 10"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-37:euclid-11-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-37","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-37.proof.1","euclid-11-37.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.37","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.37/","sourceLabel":"XI. 33"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-8:euclid-11-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-8.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.8/","sourceLabel":"XI. 33"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-11-24:explicit","id":"euclid-11-24","book":11,"number":24,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平面与平行四边形与平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-11-def-10:explicit","id":"euclid-11-def-10","book":11,"number":10,"kind":"definition","title":"全等立体：对应面相似且面积相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-6-1:explicit","id":"euclid-6-1","book":6,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"同高三角形与平行四边形的面积比等于底边比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-11-32:explicit","id":"euclid-11-32","book":11,"number":32,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平行六面体与平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-33:euclid-5-def-10:explicit","id":"euclid-5-def-10","book":5,"number":10,"kind":"definition","title":"三重比：四项连比例中的立方比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-11-37:euclid-11-33:explicit","id":"euclid-11-37","book":11,"number":37,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平行六面体与平行线与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-12-8:euclid-11-33:explicit","id":"euclid-12-8","book":12,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：棱锥与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-solid","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
